    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a feeling though. it's the reality. i look at my old work, my old interviews, and i just see a stranger. i can't fix it. there's no way to go back to how things were before the scandal. the person i was is gone. i'm just inhabitng this shell of someone people hate. it feels so permanent.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
