    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hope? there isn't any. the damage is done. you can't un-ring a bell and you can't un-say things. people don't forgive, they just move on to the next target, but they keep the memory of you to remind them why they're \"good.\" i'm just living in the aftermath of a death that hasn't actually happened yet. it's exhausting pretending i'm still here when the world has already decided i'm nothing.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
